re\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Şüphesiz bu (Kur’an) öncekilerin kitaplarında da vardı.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Ana sayfa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sûre Ash-Shu'araa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/26.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Âyet 196\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/26-196.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/26.html\">Sûre Ash-Shu&#x27;araa</a> › Âyet 196</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:196</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَإِنَّهُ لَفِي زُبُرِ الْأَوَّلِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Şüphesiz bu (Kur’an) öncekilerin kitaplarında da vardı.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإن المراد بذلك ذكره وكتابته.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 12/386</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">و &quot; الزبر &quot; جمع زبور والزبور فعول بمعنى مفعول أي مزبور أي: مكتوب فلفظ الزبور يدل على الكتابة<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 12/386</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالقرآن نفسه ليس عند بني إسرائيل ولكن ذكره كما أن محمدا نفسه ليس عندهم ولكن ذكره فثبوت الرسول في كتبهم كثبوت القرآن في كتبهم؛ بخلاف ثبوت القرآن في اللوح المحفوظ وفي المصاحف؛ فإن نفس القرآن أثبت فيها<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 12/290</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s26a196\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/26-193.html\">Önceki âyet (26:193)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/26-197.html\">Sonraki âyet (26:197)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/26-197.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:197 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"İsrail oğulları bilginlerinin onu bilmesi, onlar için ispatlayıcı bir delil (ayet) değil midir?\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/26-197.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/26-197.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/26-197.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/26-197.html\">